        <mxCell id="z13" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints &amp;amp; indexes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ratings.score: CHECK (score BETWEEN 1 AND 5)&lt;br&gt;• ratings, reviews, watchlist: UNIQUE (user_id, movie_id): one per user and movie&lt;br&gt;• reviews are shown only when is_hidden = false AND author_blocked = false (is_hidden = admin moderation; author_blocked = set by user.blocked, cleared by user.unblocked)&lt;br&gt;• Indexes: ratings(movie_id), reviews(movie_id, created_at), watch_history(user_id, watched_at), lists(user_id), list_movie(movie_id)&lt;br&gt;• movie.deleted removes the movie&amp;#39;s ratings, reviews, watchlist and history entries and list items&lt;br&gt;• lists: public lists are shown only when author_blocked = false (same events as reviews)"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1490" width="1740" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
